           "q": "Where is Highway 90 located?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>Highway 90 Dispensary is located at 90 Old Marlton Pike W., Marlton NJ. 08053 We are easily accessible to customers in the area, offering a wide range of high-quality products including <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vapes</a> <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, and more. Visit us during our operating hours to explore what we have to offer!</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "What are the operating hours of Highway 90?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>Highway 90 is open the following hours for your convenience:<br>Monday – Sunday 9am-10pm<br><br></p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
